                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nLindane is applied in a thin layer to the body below the head. No more than 30 g (1 oz) would be used. The medication is removed by washing 8 to 12 hours later. In most cases, only one application is required.\n\nTest-Taking Strategy:\nFocus on the subject, client instructions for the use of lindane. Eliminate option 2 because of the word thick. Eliminate option 3 because of the word entire. From the remaining choices, eliminate option 1 because only one application is required.",
